              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To log in to your account on **PreLicenseTraining.com** (PLT), choose the portal that matches your account type below:\n\n### 1. Student Login (Account Login)\nIf you are taking insurance pre-licensing or continuing education (CE) courses, use the standard student portal:\n* **Login Link:** [PreLicenseTraining.com Student Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/login)\n* **How to Log In:** Enter your **Email (or Login Name)** and **Password**. \n* *Tip: Your login name defaults to the email address you signed up with, unless you changed it inside your account settings.*\n\n### 2. Mentor / Recruiter Login\nIf you are a coach, manager, or recruiter tracking student progress:\n* **Login Link:** [PreLicenseTraining.com Mentor Portal](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/mentor-login)\n* **How to Log In:** Enter your registered **Email** and **Password**.\n\n---\n\n### Forgot Your Credentials?\nIf you are having trouble logging in, use the recovery tools on their site:\n* **Forgot Password:** If you need to reset your password, you can request a reset link using your account's email address.\n* **Forgot Login Name:** If you cannot remember your username, you can recover it by entering your password along with your registered email or legal first and last name.\n\n### Need to Register?\nIf you don't have an account yet and want to start a course:\n* Go to the [PreLicenseTraining Homepage](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/) to select your state and browse available insurance training programs.",
